@title A circuit follows the pointer as a ghost and a click places it
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Workflow gap row 2: Ctrl+K, motor starter, Enter puts the circuit on the pointer; click places it. No form, no Place button.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "motor starter"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
move 400 200
wait 5
shot ghost-on-pointer
click 400 200
wait 20
expect "Placed Motor starter DOL"
shot placed-by-click
